build/
build-*/
.DS_Store
*.dSYM/

# Cores, BIOS images and content are never committed to this repo. Not a
# convenience rule -- see AGENTS.md. Several cores worth using carry
# non-commercial terms, and shipping one would take this repo's MIT licence
# with it.
cores/
roms/
system/
saves/
*.dylib
*.dll
*.so
!tools/testcore/**

# The test card is BUILT, never committed -- `python3 tools/testrom/build.py`.
# Its source is MIT and ours, so this is not the licensing rule above; it is
# that "there are no ROM binaries in this repo" is a rule worth keeping absolute
# rather than one with an exception a reader has to check.
tools/testrom/testcard.gba
